{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787390/extras/2b18ee249e690394c4f542ed5f8a585b.avif?t=1771602648\" width=780 height=536 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787390/extras/93be684d1b966f486b7362d5010eac3a.avif?t=1771602648\" width=780 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Love or Last Beach Stories \u2014 a sun-drenched, adult story adventure set on a tropical beach.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a college student looking for a summer gig and maybe a little flirt. When you land a job at a trendy beach bar, things heat up fast. Beautiful strangers, secret rituals, ancient myths, and choices that matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787390/extras/4bca904df6875ce254ec733775c16e83.poster.avif?t=1771602648\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787390/extras/4bca904df6875ce254ec733775c16e83.webm?t=1771602648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787390/extras/4bca904df6875ce254ec733775c16e83.mp4?t=1771602648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when the sunsets get stranger and the cocktails start whispering secrets... You realize this summer might change more than your life.  It might change the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787390/extras/cd2a0fd80e7719f3cc79d7978e503e5c.poster.avif?t=1771602648\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787390/extras/cd2a0fd80e7719f3cc79d7978e503e5c.webm?t=1771602648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787390/extras/cd2a0fd80e7719f3cc79d7978e503e5c.mp4?t=1771602648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf78A Sultry, Story-Rich Experience</strong> <br>Dive into a branching adult narrative where your choices lead to different endings, steamy scenes, or broken hearts.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf78A Bar With Secrets</strong>  <br>Discover ancient artifacts, lost rituals, and a hidden conflict beneath the sand. Can love really save the world?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf78Bartend Your Way to Their Hearts</strong> <br>Master cocktail recipes and minigames and charm your guests, unlock hidden stories, and shake things up.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf78Insight Mode </strong> <br>Use collected \u201cenergy\u201d to activate special dialogue options and reveal hidden desires or secret paths.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf78Light vs. Lust</strong>  <br>Will you chase pleasure at any cost \u2014 or protect those you love, even at your own expense?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf78Slide Into DMs</strong>  <br>Build relationships through texts, selfies, and emotional confessions or flirty nudes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787390/extras/c367b70a42902ec23981eb04de524b23.poster.avif?t=1771602648\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a